FUTURU is a cat weather forecast.

FUTURU is not only precise forecast, but also the funniest weather app in human history.

FUTURU is a smart combination of weather reports with nice collection of cat's drawings created by our Team. Our fanny cats won't let you be bored even during cloudy days.
We provide weather forecast based on your location.

Weather data includes air temperature, wind direction and force, probability of precipitation and other parameters. Forecast is generated on daily basis. Weather data is updated at least four times a day.

Cat sketches change according to time of day, weather conditions and season. You will be surprised by diversity, unusual style and color of FUTURU funny drawings.

Source of information we use is weather forecast created by OpenWeather (https://openweathermap.org).

You will get comprehensive weather forecast for 7 days in combination with nice collection of funny cat drawings. There are no annoying ads in App, that's why nothing will distract you from viewing of weather information and funny sketches. You can use App for free during trial period. Please choose App subscription to get constant access to FUTURU drawings collection.

You can find more information regarding FUTURU in App. USER GUIDE.

FUTURU service includes the following:
- Weather forecast to date updated four times a day;
- Separate weather forecast for tomorrow;
- Advanced weather forecast for one week;
- Numerous funny sketches representing different weather conditions;
- Funny widget at the iPhone screen;
- Weather visualization in the shape of a cat (Catoscope);
- Push weather notifications;

Please, open FUTURU, smile and get your cheerfulness and good mood for the day!

Have a wonderful time and good weather!

Your FUTURU Team

